WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,850 --> 00:00:02,850
Aren't you missing? You came here first.

2
00:00:02,850 --> 00:00:03,850
I came here myself

3
00:00:03,850 --> 00:00:04,850
Who said sorry before?

4
00:00:04,850 --> 00:00:05,850
Who said they didn’t want to come?

5
00:00:05,850 --> 00:00:06,850
before was before

6
00:00:06,850 --> 00:00:08,850
Someone worked hard to get him in the door

7
00:00:08,850 --> 00:00:10,850
As a result, people now learn to walk on their own

8
00:00:10,850 --> 00:00:11,850
Stop provoking

9
00:00:11,850 --> 00:00:12,850
If you continue to argue, all of them will go back.

10
00:00:12,850 --> 00:00:13,850
Don’t take the fire

11
00:00:13,850 --> 00:00:14,850
Our camp fire is out

12
00:00:14,850 --> 00:00:16,850
Xue Ya wants three rabbits before she is willing to give him fire

13
00:00:16,850 --> 00:00:17,850
Fei Jie asked us to ask

14
00:00:17,850 --> 00:00:19,850
Can I exchange labor in the same way as before?

15
00:00:19,850 --> 00:00:21,850
Yes, record a manual debt once

16
00:00:21,850 --> 00:00:22,850
Next time I recruit workers, I will give you priority.

17
00:00:22,850 --> 00:00:23,850
It's that simple

18
00:00:23,850 --> 00:00:25,850
Otherwise, you can clear your tickets now

19
00:00:25,850 --> 00:00:26,850
accounting slip

20
00:00:26,850 --> 00:00:29,670
What to see

21
00:00:29,670 --> 00:00:31,670
I'm hungry after walking so far

22
00:00:31,670 --> 00:00:32,670
No work for me today

23
00:00:32,670 --> 00:00:33,670
Then do it now

24
00:00:33,670 --> 00:00:38,420
I'm in charge of cutting the meat

25
00:00:38,420 --> 00:00:40,420
Are you arranging a job as a chef for yourself first?

26
00:00:40,420 --> 00:00:41,420
I have quick hands

27
00:00:41,420 --> 00:00:45,940
Okay, half an hour

28
00:00:45,940 --> 00:00:46,940
Do as much as you want

29
00:00:46,940 --> 00:00:47,940
Don't waste time on AnGong

30
00:00:47,940 --> 00:00:51,470
I really came by myself

31
00:00:51,470 --> 00:00:53,660
Where has it developed?
